    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name comes from a shallow stretch of the Tennessee River where mussels were once gathered by early settlers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muscle_Shoals%2C_Alabama"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Muscle Shoals was founded in 1923 and quickly became known for the Tennessee Valley Authority’s electrification projects.",
