      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityofmuscleshoals.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1972, The Staple Singers’ “I’ll Take You There” recorded at Muscle Shoals became a benchmark of the region’s sound.",
